1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''1701 Manntall (Sven is listed at Lille Birkeland, and is claimed to be 47 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Manntallet 1701, nr. 4: Jæren og Dalane fogderi, 1701, s. 58-59. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271043
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Skoskatten 1711 (Sven is listed at Lille Birkeland, as a widower with one daughter):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Fogderegnskap, RA/EA-4092/R46/L2735: Fogderegnskap Jæren og Dalane, 1711, s. 329. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100337
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (13-06-1722; Sven had died, in 1721, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Elisabet Torgersdatter, and his son Jakob Svensen):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0005: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106670430
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his I wife (13-05-1711; Guri had died, and the widower, Sven Jakobsen, is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 262b-263a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660563
2 CONT ----
