2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gård og ætt på Røyneberg og Mauland av Arnold Røyneberg.'''  
2 CONT Anna f. 1865, Olaus f. 1869 og Sven f. 1870 reiste sammen via Liverpool med båten Teutonic og kom til Amerika 9. mars 1892. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/67897357/anna_j-rapstad
2 CONT
2 CONT The community was shocked Monday afternoon by the report that Mrs. J.L. Rapstad, wife of the well known wool grower on Big Timber creek, had died suddenly from an overdose of acetanelide taken to relieve pain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Deceased was 38 years old and besides her husband leaves four children, the oldest being 8 years old.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Rapstad's maiden name was Annie Mauland. There are four brothers in this state while in the old country resides her mother, three sisters and three brothers.
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral will take place Saturday afternoon. There will be a short service at the family residence on Big Timber creek at 1 o'clock and services at the Congregational church here at 2:30. Interment will be in the local cemetery
2 CONC .
