1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigrid immigrated with her sister Joran on the S.S. Hellig Olav in 1911 at the age of 22. Married Martin Tunheim on 9-13-1927 at the age of 38.  Martin had 7 other children by a previous marriage. Together they had
2 CONC  a son Arne Martin Tunheim (1931-2005).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigrid married Martin Tunheim later in her years.  She was 38 and he was 59.  This was his second marriage.  He was married in 1893 to Ane Oline Evinsdatter Garborg.  Together they have seven children: Myrtel Tunheim  Toralf Tunhe
2 CONC im 1894			Martin Tunehim (12-3-1867 to 4-14-1937) Edvard Tunheim 1896			He was born in Klepp, Norway and immigrated in 1886. Alma Tunheim 1898 Olg Tunheim 1901 Olaf Tunheim 1903 Cora Tunheim 1907
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1930 census lists them living in Warren, Marshall, Minnesota. Martin died at the age of 63 (1930 in Warren, Minnesota).    He was in the livestock business.
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had one son Arne M. Tunheim (8-3-1931 to 1-6-2005) Age 73.
2 CONT
