1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.helgeland.nu/english/genealogy/Other/Stavanger/joergine_svela.htm#i11433
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole Torgerson, son of Torger Omundson and Unknown, was born in 1659 in Landsdal, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1732 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 73, and was buried on 4. May 1732 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkrei
2 CONC m, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ole married Marete Eivindsdotter circa 1681 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT *i. Rasmus Olson was born in 1682 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Lomeland, Helleland, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *ii. Gjertrud Olsdotter d. e. was born circa 1684 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Apeland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Gjertrud married Erik Toreson, son of Tore Svendson and Ingeborg Gardsdotter d. y., circa 170
2 CONC 5 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Gjertrud next married Ole Villumson, son of Villum and Unknown, on 20. Oct 1720 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *iii [70]. Lars Olson. Lars married Berta Rasmusdotter, daughter of Rasmus Atlakson and Randi Torgersdotter, circa 1712 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Lars next married Jorunn Gunnarsdotter, daughter of Gunnar Børi
2 CONC ldson and Maren Toresdotter, on 17. Feb 1724 in Helleland kyrkje, Helleland, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *iv [68]. Torger Olson. Torger married Guri Mauritsdotter, daughter of Maurits Rasmusson and Valborg Torgersdotter, on 17. Oct 1717 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *v. Gunhild Olsdotter was born circa 1693 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Tengesdal nordre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Gunhild married Lars Pederson d. e., son of Peder Larsson and Guri Olsdotter, on 2. Jul 1713
2 CONC  in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *vi. Eivind Olson was born in 1695 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1749 in Tengesdal søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 54. Another name for Eivind was Evind. Eivind married Ædi Nilsdotter, daughter of Ni
2 CONC ls Gardson and Siri Olsdotter, on 21. Jun 1722 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Eivind next married Siri Salvesdotter, daughter of Salve Henrikson and Guri Knudsdotter, on 22. Oct 1724 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim,
2 CONC  Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *vii. Gjertrud Olsdotter d. y. was born in 1700 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1732 in Tysland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 32, and was buried on 30. Mar 1732 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Gj
2 CONC ertrud married Gard Nilsson, son of Nils Gardson and Siri Olsdotter, on 25. Jun 1719 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Gjertrud next married Nils Salomonson, son of Salomon Styrkårson and Guri Gjermundsdotter, on 2. N
2 CONC ov 1721 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT *viii. Kari Olsdotter was born circa 1701 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Kari married Torger Fredrikson on 29. Sep 1727 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>Åslandsætten s.28.</p><p><p>Gravlagd 4. mai 1732. Vi vet ikke hvor Ola Torgerson var kommet fra. Han var gift med Marit Eivindsdtr. Kløgetveit. Born:</p></p><p><p>a. Lars, ugift</p></p><p><p>b. Torger Kløgetveit, f.1691, d.1772
2 CONC , g.17.10.1717 med Guri Torgersdtr. Røysland.</p></p><p><p>c. Eivind Tengesdal</p></p><p><p>d. Gunhild(sjå denne), g.m. Nils Salomonson Kløgetveit</p></p><p><p>e. Kari Røysland</p></p><p>f. Gjertrud (sjå denne), f.1700, d.1774, g.
2 CONC m. Gard Nilsson Tengesdal.</p>
