1 NAME Lars Sveinungson /Haukamork/
2 GIVN Lars Sveinungson
2 _MARNM Haukamork
1 SEX M
1 BAPM
2 DATE 8 AUG 1723
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 AUG 1723
2 PLAC Rage
