2 CONT
2 CONT Rose Florence Hauge Holm BIRTH	29 Apr 1895 Jewell, Hamilton County, Iowa, USA DEATH	27 May 1976 (aged 81) Blue Earth, Faribault County, Minnesota, USA BURIAL	 East Chain Lutheran Cemetery East Chain, Martin County, Minnesota, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT ELMORE - Service for Rose Holm, 81, of Pilot Grove will be 2 p.m. Sunday at East Chain Lutheran Church with burial in the church cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Visitation will be from noon today at the Wicks Funeral Home in Elmore and one hour before service at the church on Sunday.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Holm died Thursday at St. Luke's Home in Blue Earth.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born April 29, 1895 at Jewell, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edwin Holm Dec. 29, 1915 at Elmore.
2 CONT
2 CONT They lived seven years at Svea, Minn. and then moved to Pilot Grove where he managed the general store and lumber yard.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Holm has been at the St. Lukes's Home since last September.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include a son, Ray of Elmore; three daughters, Mrs. Casper Dahl of Elmore, Mrs. Rose Holland of Frost, and Mrs. Don Clark of Rochester; 17 grandchildren, and 31 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
