1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Høyland gards- og ættesoge gjennom 400 år 1500 - 1900, Stokka, s. 394, nr. 34.d, https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2015120729003?page=397
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT  Samuel Johnsen, son of John Tollakson and Elisabet Samuelsdotter, was born on 6. Jun 1821 in Stokka, Høyland, Rogaland, NOR, died on 11. Jun 1870 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR at age 49, and was buried on 17. Jun 1870 in Hetl
2 CONC and kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He is mentioned in 1865 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR. 45 år, Gaardsbr og Selveier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married Karen Andersdotter on 1. Jul 1847 in Stavanger Domkyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1         i.  Johanne Elisabeth Jaatten. Johanne married John Assersen on 10. Nov 1870 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT          ii.  Anna Elisabeth Jaatten was born on 17. Mar 1852 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 4. Apr 1852 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR, died on 19. Jan 1893 in Godeset, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR at
2 CONC  age 40, and was buried on 27. Jan 1893 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR. The cause of her death was Brystbetændelse. Another name for Anna was Ane E.
2 CONT
2 CONT         iii.  Sikke Karine Jaatten was born on 1. Sep 1854 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 8. Oct 1854 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR, and died in Boganes, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR. Other names for 
2 CONC Sikke were Sikke Carine and Zikke. Sikke married John Nilsen Boganes on 8. Mar 1877 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT          iv.  Jonas Samuelsen Jaatten was born on 28. Feb 1857 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 9. Apr 1857 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR, died on 23. Nov 1887 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR at
2 CONC  age 30, and was buried on 30. Nov 1887 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT           v.  Hans Andreas Samuelsen Jaatten was born on 15. Feb 1860 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 18. Mar 1860 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR, died on 10. Jul 1880 in Jåtten, Hetland, Rogaland
2 CONC , NOR at age 20, and was buried on 15. Jul 1880 in Hetland kyrkje, Stavanger, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Hans was Mons A. 
2 CONT --------------------
