2 CONT
2 CONT Bonnie Jean Tunheim
2 CONT BIRTH	14 Sep 1959
2 CONT Minneapolis, Hennepin County, Minnesota, USA
2 CONT DEATH	6 Jul 2018 (aged 58)
2 CONT Winston, Douglas County, Georgia, USA
2 CONT BURIAL	Cremated
2 CONT
2 CONT Bonnie Jean Tunheim, age 58 of Winston, Georgia, passed away July 6, 2018. She was born September, 14, 1959 in Minniapolis, Minnesota, daughter of the late Arne Martin Tunheim and Dorothy Jean Olsen Tunheim. She proudly served in 
2 CONC the United States Navy for more than 5 years and worked in the B.I. Software Development department of IBM for more than 16 years. She is survived by her loving husband, William Cawley Chandler. Bonnie had been recently diagnosed 
2 CONC with breast cancer and upon receiving the news, she and her husband shared a motto that they intended to follow which was; “Go not in haste, but linger not in pain.” In keeping with Bonnie and William’s wishes, her body has been c
2 CONC remated and a service and inurnment will take place in Minnesota. Martin-Hightower Heritage Chapel, Carrollton, Georgia.
2 CONT
