1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.helgeland.nu/english/genealogy/Other/Stavanger/joergine_svela.htm#i12704
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Olson, son of Ole Torgerson and Marete Eivindsdotter, was born in 1689 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1732 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 43, and was buried on 30. May 1732 in Bjerkreim kyrkj
2 CONC e, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He is mentioned in 1701 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 12 år.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars married Berta Rasmusdotter, daughter of Rasmus Atlakson and Randi Torgersdotter, circa 1712 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Larsson was born in 1714 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1714 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, and was buried on 16. Dec 1714 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Larsdotter was born in 1716 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1716 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, and was buried on 10. May 1716 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Randi Larsdotter was born in 1721 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 13. Feb 1721 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1721 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, and was buri
2 CONC ed on 16. Mar 1721 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Randi was Rangdi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars next married Jorunn Gunnarsdotter on 17. Feb 1724 in Helleland kyrkje, Helleland, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 35 i. Berete Larsdotter. Berete married Tomas Olson, son of Ole Tomasson and Kirsti Rasmusdotter, on 28. May 1745 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Berete next married Torger Torgerson, son of Torger Olson and Guri Ma
2 CONC uritsdotter, on 24. Jun 1746 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Ambjørg Larsdotter was born in 1730 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 28. May 1730 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1731 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 1, and was 
2 CONC buried on 22. Jul 1731 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Ambjørg was Anbiør. 
